into your best version,

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.352
but let me finish with this.

00:11:21.352 --> 00:11:23.831
After you have your mask properly secured

00:11:23.831 --> 00:11:27.245
and you're able to breathe,
it becomes your obligation,

00:11:27.245 --> 00:11:31.020
your duty to help others
secure their mask,

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:32.910
so ain't nothing wrong with being selfish

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:35.592
in the beginning, but
make sure the end game

00:11:35.592 --> 00:11:39.191
is to be selfless,
because to be the only one

00:11:39.191 --> 00:11:42.051
breathing on a plane while
everybody else is unconscious,

00:11:42.051 --> 00:11:44.636
will surely put you on a crash course

00:11:44.636 --> 00:11:46.969
for loneliness and disaster.

00:11:48.293 --> 00:11:51.866
Every day we allow and
even encourage people

00:11:51.866 --> 00:11:54.609
to dump garbage into our
minds and into our lives.

00:11:54.609 --> 00:11:57.477
See, contrary to popular
belief, you don't just

00:11:57.477 --> 00:12:00.293
consume nutrients through
food by way of your mouth.

00:12:00.293 --> 00:12:02.818
You also consume through your
eyes and through your ears.

00:12:02.818 --> 00:12:05.035
You ever wonder why you're
feeling negative or angry?

00:12:05.035 --> 00:12:07.796
It's because your input
determines your output,

00:12:07.796 --> 00:12:10.091
the garbage that you
listen to on the radio,

00:12:10.091 --> 00:12:12.994
the trash you see on TV,
the bullshh that you hear

00:12:12.994 --> 00:12:15.353
from the people that you hang out with.

00:12:15.353 --> 00:12:17.058
It rubs off on you.

00:12:17.058 --> 00:12:20.029
Everybody talks about
GMO, stay away from GMOs.

00:12:20.029 --> 00:12:22.589
Well stay away from the
human GMOs, the greedy,

00:12:22.589 --> 00:12:24.418
the miserable, the obnoxious.

00:12:24.418 --> 00:12:25.718
These people are toxic.

00:12:25.718 --> 00:12:27.787
They drain you, they complain, they remind

00:12:27.787 --> 00:12:29.050
you of your mistakes.

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:30.896
They tear you down, the
gossip, they aren't there

00:12:30.896 --> 00:12:33.681
for you when you need them
and some of these people

00:12:33.681 --> 00:12:35.181
are even in your family.

00:12:35.181 --> 00:12:37.340
But these aren't necessarily evil people,

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.348
they're just trapped
in a cycle themselves,

00:12:39.348 --> 00:12:41.402
but that's their problem, not yours.

00:12:41.402 --> 00:12:42.681
You can't fix them.

00:12:42.681 --> 00:12:45.586
You have fix yourself and
become an example for them.

00:12:45.586 --> 00:12:47.497
So politely just give yourself some space

00:12:47.497 --> 00:12:49.471
from these people or else
you're going to end up

00:12:49.471 --> 00:12:50.721
just like them.

00:12:51.805 --> 00:12:53.128
You keep hanging out with losers,

00:12:53.128 --> 00:12:54.709
you're going to wind up picking up

00:12:54.709 --> 00:12:55.973
the qualities of a loser.

00:12:55.973 --> 00:12:58.081
Hang out with people that encourage you

00:12:58.081 --> 00:13:01.313
and empower you to become
the best version of yourself.

00:13:01.313 --> 00:13:02.490
You deserve that.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:04.138
You deserve to be happy.

00:13:04.138 --> 00:13:06.615
You deserve to be you.

00:13:06.615 --> 00:13:08.099
So figure out what you want out of life.

00:13:08.099 --> 00:13:10.113
Because you're going
to be the only with you

00:13:10.113 --> 00:13:11.472
for the rest of it.

00:13:11.472 --> 00:13:12.836
Life is short.

00:13:12.836 --> 00:13:14.723
And as a wise woman once said,

00:13:14.723 --> 00:13:17.482
fake friends, negative friends,

00:13:17.482 --> 00:13:20.065
ain't nobody got time for that.

