don't need to be there?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:40.607
Times we could be on
the beach buried in sand

00:13:40.607 --> 00:13:42.581
or traveling the earth.

00:13:42.581 --> 00:13:46.294
We spend it in the office
traveling from desk to desk,

00:13:46.294 --> 00:13:48.351
buried in paperwork.

00:13:48.351 --> 00:13:52.471
See, in this chaotic world,
everything goes so fast.

00:13:52.471 --> 00:13:55.112
We're so busy it seems like everyone's

00:13:55.112 --> 00:13:57.856
middle name is multitask.

