00:14:31.726 --> 00:14:33.738
not a single soul.

00:14:33.738 --> 00:14:36.488
And you never get them back, see?

00:14:37.844 --> 00:14:39.330
There one goes.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:42.107
No do overs, no rewind,
