00:15:34.895 --> 00:15:39.062
The most precious thing we
have in life are moments.

00:15:40.706 --> 00:15:43.063
Let's make the most of
them before they disappear.

00:15:43.063 --> 00:15:45.154
Let's see the world while we still can

00:15:45.154 --> 00:15:47.649
