Well, the natural state of the mind

00:28:00.019 --> 00:28:03.287
is full of thought, mental
noise and once you accept that,

00:28:03.287 --> 00:28:05.667
the easier it will be to go beyond it,

00:28:05.667 --> 00:28:07.925
because you are not the mind.

00:28:07.925 --> 00:28:09.916
You have a mind, but the problem is

00:28:09.916 --> 00:28:12.720
you have been identifying with the mind,

00:28:12.720 --> 00:28:16.052
