is every thought made out of?

00:28:31.006 --> 00:28:31.839
Nothing.

00:28:32.754 --> 00:28:35.799
You bring it to life with
the attention you give it.

00:28:35.799 --> 00:28:39.807
See, every single day we
have 50 to 70,000 thoughts,

00:28:39.807 --> 00:28:42.262
