00:28:59.045 --> 00:29:01.096
So both aversion and attraction feed

00:29:01.096 --> 00:29:03.431
and multiply thoughts.

00:29:03.431 --> 00:29:06.681
The secret is just don't mind the mind.

00:29:08.047 --> 00:29:10.239
Know that this is the
natural state of the mind.

00:29:10.239 --> 00:29:11.235
Don't feed it.

00:29:11.235 --> 00:29:13.348
You do that by not trying to control,

00:29:13.348 --> 00:29:18.004
