00:29:29.707 --> 00:29:31.652
Just stay as the pure awareness.

00:29:31.652 --> 00:29:34.110
This is a much higher place,

00:29:34.110 --> 00:29:36.307
your true place in silence.

00:29:36.307 --> 00:29:38.907
So yeah, thoughts will
arise and you feel them,

00:29:38.907 --> 00:29:41.102
yeah, you're going to feel
them, but they will pass.

00:29:41.102 --> 00:29:43.279
You don't have to follow them anymore

00:29:43.279 --> 00:29:44.859
down the rabbit hole.

00:29:44.859 --> 00:29:47.232
Just remember, it's just a thought.

00:29:47.232 --> 00:29:50.105
Don't touch it, just stop
and fix your attention

00:29:50.105 --> 00:29:52.395
in that silence, nothing
more, very simpmle.

00:29:52.395 --> 00:29:55.713
You don't have to fight control

00:29:55.713 --> 00:29:58.494
or defeat the mind, just stay as you are.

00:29:58.494 --> 00:29:59.858
How simple is that?

00:29:59.858 --> 00:30:02.028
Just stay as you are as the silence

00:30:02.028 --> 00:30:04.914
in between two thoughts and the mind will

00:30:04.914 --> 00:30:09.221
dissolve by itself into the
nothingness that it really is.

00:30:09.221 --> 00:30:11.172
Hey, yo, whatever it is
that you're going through,

00:30:11.172 --> 00:30:14.116
I want to tell you that
you are exactly where

00:30:14.116 --> 00:30:15.316
you need to be.

00:30:15.316 --> 00:30:17.186
You see this?

00:30:17.186 --> 00:30:18.648
This is a lotus flower.

00:30:18.648 --> 00:30:21.714
Some say it is the most
beautiful fragrant flowre

00:30:21.714 --> 00:30:23.484
on the face of the earth,

00:30:23.484 --> 00:30:27.910
but the funny thing is, it
was born out of the nasty

00:30:27.910 --> 00:30:29.410
dirty, ugly swamp.

00:30:30.998 --> 00:30:33.151
The swamp, the mud.

00:30:33.151 --> 00:30:37.277
You don't grow lotuses on
marble or in the highlands,

00:30:37.277 --> 00:30:40.469
only from the mud can this
beautiful flower emerge.

00:30:40.469 --> 00:30:44.190
I want to tell you that you are the lotus.

00:30:44.190 --> 00:30:47.702
All of the ugly situations, your past,

00:30:47.702 --> 00:30:50.869
the struggle, the strife is necessary.

00:30:51.807 --> 00:30:54.640
You need these situations to force

00:30:55.586 --> 00:30:57.655
you to become what you were destined to be

00:30:57.655 --> 00:30:59.916
which is greatness.

00:30:59.916 --> 00:31:01.379
So hold your ground.

00:31:01.379 --> 00:31:03.004
Keep moving forward out of that mud.

00:31:03.004 --> 00:31:05.518
I promise you that you will get through

00:31:05.518 --> 00:31:08.526
and all of that ugliness, the struggle,

00:31:08.526 --> 00:31:11.050
the strife will make your victory speech

00:31:11.050 --> 00:31:13.133
that much more beautiful.

00:31:15.090 --> 00:31:15.923
Peace.

